{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16107210","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1610720001:":{"text":"……弗朗茨？怎么是他？！","source_cn":"……弗朗茨？怎么是他？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5FBF624CA9E3D316","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……弗朗茨？怎么是他？！","female":"……弗朗茨？怎么是他？！","variant_male_record_index":"198063","variant_female_record_index":"198064","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610721001:1":{"text":"你能找到这里，真是位聪明的顾客。","source_cn":"你能找到这里，真是位聪明的顾客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x115BB8F06A89DC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610721002:1":{"text":"啊！你吓了我一跳！好可怕啊……你、你是……？","source_cn":"啊！你吓了我一跳！好可怕啊……你、你是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C4CA415EA5DB9E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610721003:1":{"text":"别紧张，我知道你从“魔力绽放”来的，对吧？我就是你想要找的人。","source_cn":"别紧张，我知道你从“魔力绽放”来的，对吧？我就是你想要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC24AC6C9E44B2F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610721004:1":{"text":"你……你知道我想要什么？我……","source_cn":"你……你知道我想要什么？我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7070665ECB4471B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610721005:1":{"text":"我当然知道你想要什么。有很多学生都和你一样想要“定制化饮品”，但只有最聪明的那部分人才能找到这里，成为我的商业合作伙伴。","source_cn":"我当然知道你想要什么。有很多学生都和你一样想要“定制化...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C0136BA6EAE6A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610721006:1":{"text":"我真喜欢你们这些优秀的年轻人啊，每一位都是具有极高回报率的潜力股。","source_cn":"我真喜欢你们这些优秀的年轻人啊，每一位都是具有极高回报...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0328D681DD5117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610721007:1":{"text":"商业合作伙伴？不，我……我只想像我朋友那样提升魔力。","source_cn":"商业合作伙伴？不，我……我只想像我朋友那样提升魔力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78D7BDB4EABE4A94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610721008:1":{"text":"你知道吗？上个月有位和你魔法水平相似的孩子跟我达成了合作，而现在他的魔力收益涨幅……是令他非常愉悦的66.6%。","source_cn":"你知道吗？上个月有位和你魔法水平相似的孩子跟我达成了合...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x476F850F040F9744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610721009:1":{"text":"而你，作为优质潜力股，只要你愿意，就能获得更多。","source_cn":"而你，作为优质潜力股，只要你愿意，就能获得更多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9884FB702031014F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum